OL,3,GNEWSADriver seriously injured in
OL,4,Afour-vehicle A34 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major road has reopened after a
OL,7,Fdriver was taken to hospital with
OL,8,Fserious injuries following a crash.
OL,10,FThe A34 was closed in both directions
OL,11,Fnear Chieveley Services, near Newbury,
OL,12,Fat about 11:00 BST after the crash on
OL,13,Fthe northbound carriageway between a
OL,14,Fwhite van, a red car and two other
OL,15,Fvehicles.
OL,17,FThe southbound carriageway reopened at
OL,18,Fabout 13:30, and National Highways said
OL,19,Fshortly before 18:30 that all lanes in
OL,20,Fboth directions were now open again.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
